[{"id":2739163061,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6jRE-1","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101774#pullrequestreview-2739163061","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101774","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-03T09:41:51Z"},{"id":2740995013,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6jYEPF","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","login":"bruvzg","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg"},"body":"I have tested as is and rebased on top of master, apart from aforementioned popup issue everything seems to be working as expected. Code looks good.\r\n\r\nNot sure if it's necessarily should be done in this PR, but having two `FLAG_POPUP` and `FLAG_POPUP_WM_HINT` flags which have extremely similar function and might be a bit confusing.\r\n\r\nThe only difference in the usage seems to be `FLAG_POPUP` is unset for tooltips (since it's controlling input capture), so it might be better to use `FLAG_POPUP` instead of `FLAG_POPUP_WM_HINT` for Wayland, and add a new `FLAG_TOOLTIP` which will override `FLAG_POPUP` on other platforms.\r\n \r\nSomething like this (a quick and completely untested draft): https://gist.github.com/bruvzg/a3f8e468af7ef416f5e8c10d0e4ea47b\r\n\r\nOr we should rename `FLAG_POPUP` to something else, like `FLAG_CAPTURE_ALL_INPUT_WITHOUT_FOCUS_AND_AUTOCLOSE_WHEN_CLICKED_OUTSIDE` (no idea what the good name for it would be).","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101774#pullrequestreview-2740995013","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101774","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-03T21:18:31Z"},{"id":2743671611,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6jiRs7","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","login":"deralmas","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101774#pullrequestreview-2743671611","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101774","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-04-04T17:14:24Z"},{"id":2743672874,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6jiSAq","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31065808?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/deralmas","id":31065808,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMDY1ODA4","login":"deralmas","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/deralmas"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101774#pullrequestre